## Key Changes for Gemini Support

### 1. Dual-Provider API Service
- Modified [api_service.dart](file:///c:/projects/kizimin_arkadasi/kizimin_arkadasi/lib/services/api_service.dart) to support both OpenAI and Google Gemini formats.
